What is that like from the waiter's point of view?
从服务员的角度来看，那是什么感觉？

1173
00:51:53.670 --> 00:51:58.530
I mean, you know, I walked in a restaurant, you know, people like you walk up, sometimes
我是说，你知道的，我走进餐厅，你知道，像你们这样的人走过来，有时

