00:53:50.400 --> 00:53:55.920
And then Jenna, Michael decides that he's going to also try to comfort her in this moment.
然后珍娜，迈克尔决定他也要在这个时刻安慰她。

1221
00:53:56.640 --> 00:53:57.800
It's in the deleted scenes.
这在删减片段里。

