How awkward is that car ride for Pam?
帕姆那段车程得有多尴尬啊？

1257
00:55:35.280 --> 00:55:36.440
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1258
00:55:37.140 --> 00:55:40.800
I mean, Pam has had to hear so much today.
我是说，帕姆今天被迫听了太多东西。

1259
00:55:41.160 --> 00:55:42.100
So much.
太多了。

1260
00:55:43.420 --> 00:55:44.580
Maybe she already knew.
也许她早就知道了。

1261
00:55:44.720 --> 00:55:47.140
I mean, it sounds like they're close, but I don't know.
我是说，听起来他们关系很近，但我也不确定。

1262
00:55:47.240 --> 00:55:49.900
I think there's new information coming at her today.
我觉得今天有新情况传到她耳朵里了。

1263
00:55:50.160 --> 00:55:50.760
Uh, yeah.
呃，是啊。

1264
00:55:51.620 --> 00:55:53.200
Well, they get back to the office.
好吧，他们回到了办公室。

1265
