Starbucks gift card.
星巴克礼品卡。

1274
00:56:09.600 --> 00:56:10.400
From everyone.
大家一起送的。

1275
00:56:10.980 --> 00:56:15.640
Were you curious how Andy got the whole group to chip in for a gift card for Dwight?
你好奇安迪是怎么让大家伙儿凑钱给德怀特买礼品卡的吗？

1276
