趁他不在，安迪站起来向办公区宣布了一件事。

1283
00:56:29.560 --> 00:56:35.060
He says, maybe you noticed Dwight has been trying real hard to do nice things for us.
他说，也许你们注意到了，德怀特最近一直在努力为我们做些好事。

1284
00:56:35.240 --> 00:56:36.760
That's not his normal way.
那可不是他平时的作风。

1285
00:56:36.760 --> 00:56:38.720
And he's not having an easy time with it.
而且他做起来并不容易。

1286
00:56:39.060 --> 00:56:40.820
And like the bullpen's like, who cares?
办公区的人反应是，谁在乎啊？

1287
00:56:40.980 --> 00:56:41.920
Stanley's like, so.
斯坦利说，那又怎样。

1288
00:56:42.160 --> 00:56:43.420
Meredith's like, what's your game?
梅雷迪斯说，你到底想玩什么花样？

1289
00:56:44.080 --> 00:56:45.760
Andy's like, we need to give him a gift.
安迪说，我们得送他一份礼物。

1290
00:56:46.040 --> 00:56:47.080
And Creed's like, what?
克里德说，什么？

1291
00:56:47.140 --> 00:56:47.800
Like a present?
像礼物那样的东西？

1292
00:56:49.400 --> 00:56:50.280
Andy continues.
安迪继续说道。

1293
00:56:50.720 --> 00:56:53.620
He says, Dwight wakes up every day at 4 a.m.
他说，德怀特每天凌晨四点起床。

1294
00:56:53.740 --> 00:56:54.500
and kills a pig.
然后杀一头猪。

1295
00:56:54.700 --> 00:56:55.540
That's his workout.
那就是他的锻炼方式。

1296
00:56:55.760 --> 00:56:56.780
He's not like us.
他跟我们不一样。

1297
00:56:56.900 --> 00:56:58.160
But today he tried.
但今天他努力了。

1298
00:56:58.360 --> 00:57:01.140
And you know, it wasn't too long ago I had a temper.
而且你知道吗，不久前我脾气还很暴躁。

1299
00:57:01.840 --> 00:57:03.260
I was a real bastard.
我那时真是个混蛋。

1300
00:57:03.540 --> 00:57:05.100
And do you know what got me out of it?
你知道是什么让我走出来的吗？

1301
00:57:05.680 --> 00:57:10.500
Oscar comes in with some snark and says, mandatory anger management.
奥斯卡带着讽刺走进来，说，强制性的情绪管理。

1302
00:57:11.580 --> 00:57:13.920
We're calling back all this stuff.
我们要把这些东西都收回来。

1303
00:57:14.220 --> 00:57:14.480
Yeah.
没错。

1304
00:57:14.920 --> 00:57:16.340
And Andy goes, no.
然后安迪说，不行。

1305
00:57:16.640 --> 00:57:20.040
And he like wants to shout at Oscar so badly.
他特别想对奥斯卡大吼大叫。

1306
00:57:20.240 --> 00:57:22.220
And Ed is really funny in this scene.
艾德在这一幕里真的很有趣。

1307
00:57:22.360 --> 00:57:26.640
He goes, no, the kindness and gentle words of my anger management sponsor.
他说，不，这是我情绪管理导师的仁慈与温言。

1308
00:57:26.920 --> 00:57:31.480
And his whole thing is, guys, my point is, maybe we can be that for Dwight.
他整段话的意思是，伙计们，我的意思是，也许我们也能那样对待德怀特。

1309
00:57:31.720 --> 00:57:33.120
We can be that person.
我们可以成为那样的人。

1310
00:57:35.600 --> 00:57:40.260
And Phyllis, coming in hard with the sass, says, look, we all do nice things.
菲利斯毫不客气地反驳道，听着，我们都做过好事。

1311
00:57:40.440 --> 00:57:42.500
I bring in muffins at least once a week.
我至少每周带一次松饼来。

1312
00:57:42.860 --> 00:57:46.500
And Stanley says, those are leftover book group muffins.
斯坦利说，那是读书会剩下的松饼。

1313
00:57:47.340 --> 00:57:48.500
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1314
00:57:48.500 --> 00:57:49.700
There's so much sass.
火药味太浓了。

1315
00:57:50.020 --> 00:57:52.200
Anyway, Andy's like, hey, we're getting off topic.
总之，安迪说，嘿，我们跑题了。

1316
00:57:52.240 --> 00:57:53.220
He's coming back.
他要回来了。

1317
00:57:53.300 --> 00:57:54.860
Will you guys please give me some money?
你们能给我点钱吗？

1318
00:57:54.860 --> 00:58:01.720
So when Dwight gets the gift card and it pans to the bullpen, do you see how like everyone is like, whatever?
所以当德怀特拿到礼品卡，镜头切到办公区时，你们看到大家那种无所谓的态度了吗？

1319
00:58:02.160 --> 00:58:02.420
Yeah.
看到了。

1320
00:58:02.760 --> 00:58:03.660
That's why.
就是因为这个。

1321
00:58:04.400 --> 00:58:05.000
Wow.
哇。

1322
00:58:05.800 --> 00:58:07.120
The shooting draft.
拍摄剧本。

1323
00:58:07.240 --> 00:58:08.240
The shooting draft.
拍摄剧本。

1324
00:58:08.700 --> 00:58:13.000
Well, Michael is going to ask Pam to come in his office.
迈克尔打算叫帕姆去他办公室。

1325
00:58:13.000 --> 00:58:13.900
It's about work.
是关于工作的。

1326
00:58:13.900 --> 00:58:14.800
It really is.
确实是。

1327
00:58:14.920 --> 00:58:16.360
It is about work.
就是关于工作的。

1328
00:58:16.480 --> 00:58:17.180
It is.
没错。

1329
00:58:17.400 --> 00:58:17.800
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1330
00:58:18.320 --> 00:58:20.440
He is going to offer her a raise.
他打算给她加薪。

1331
00:58:21.120 --> 00:58:22.480
She's going to take it.
她会接受的。

1332
00:58:22.800 --> 00:58:23.240
Yeah.
是的。

1333
00:58:23.720 --> 00:58:26.260
But it's still not changing her mood towards him.
但这依然没能改变她对他的态度。

1334
00:58:26.800 --> 00:58:27.100
No.
没有。

1335
00:58:27.520 --> 00:58:33.680
And he wants her to know that the raise has strings attached from his heart to her mean attitude.
他想让她知道，这笔加薪是有附加条件的，源于他的一片心意，针对她恶劣的态度。

1336
00:58:36.160 --> 00:58:37.600
Pam's like, are you bribing me?
帕姆说，你在贿赂我吗？

1337
00:58:37.720 --> 00:58:38.960
And then he's like, well, what do you want?
然后他说，那，你想要什么？

1338
00:58:39.040 --> 00:58:39.380
What do you want?
你想要什么？

1339
00:58:39.460 --> 00:58:40.420
Do you want a million dollars?
你想要一百万美元吗？

1340
00:58:40.600 --> 00:58:41.500
Do you want to hit me?
你想打我吗？

1341
00:58:42.120 --> 00:58:43.640
She says, I want to hit you.
她说，我想打你。

1342
00:58:44.440 --> 00:58:48.200
Lady, this plot line was so controversial.
天哪，这条剧情线当时争议太大了。

1343
00:58:49.240 --> 00:58:53.100
When this ended up airing, oh, my gosh, it lit up the message boards.
播出的时候，天哪，留言板都炸锅了。

1344
00:58:53.240 --> 00:58:53.980
I bet.
我敢肯定。

1345
00:58:54.420 --> 00:58:58.520
Not only does she want to hit him, but she says, in the parking lot in front of everyone,
她不仅想打他，还说，在停车场当着所有人的面，

1346
00:58:58.760 --> 00:59:00.400
I'm going to hit you as hard as I can.
我要用尽全力打你。

1347
00:59:01.180 --> 00:59:03.300
Everyone gets very invested very quickly.
大家很快就都投入进来了。

1348
00:59:03.800 --> 00:59:06.020
There's a lot of chatter around the office.
办公室里议论纷纷。

1349
00:59:06.220 --> 00:59:10.020
And Toby is like, Pam, can I talk to you for a second?
托比说，帕姆，我能跟你谈谈吗？

1350
00:59:10.100 --> 00:59:13.080
We all think he's human resources and he's going to stop this.
我们都以为他是人力资源部的，会阻止这件事。

1351
00:59:13.380 --> 00:59:13.640
Yes.
没错。

1352
00:59:14.760 --> 00:59:18.460
But Toby just wants to confirm that she'll be hitting him off property.
但托比只想确认她会去公司外面揍他。

1353
00:59:18.460 --> 00:59:21.360
And then he wants to show her how to throw a punch.
然后他还想教她怎么出拳。

1354
00:59:21.840 --> 00:59:22.960
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1355
00:59:23.500 --> 00:59:28.820
Charlie Grandy said that Paul is the one who pitched this bit.
查理·格兰迪说这个桥段是保罗提出来的。

1356
00:59:29.040 --> 00:59:31.780
He pitched it in the room during the rewrite.
他在重写剧本时在会议室里提出来的。

1357
00:59:32.820 --> 00:59:36.400
And Charlie said he was pretty new on the office at this time.
查理说他当时刚进《办公室》剧组不久。

1358
00:59:36.720 --> 00:59:40.440
And when Paul was first pitching it, he thought, well, I don't know.
保罗刚提出这个点子时，他心想，嗯，我不知道。

1359
00:59:40.520 --> 00:59:44.960
How are we going to – how is this going to, like, play realistically and funny?
我们要怎么做——这要怎么拍才能既真实又好笑呢？

1360
00:59:45.440 --> 00:59:47.360
But Paul was like, I know how to do it.
但保罗说，我知道怎么做。

1361
00:59:47.400 --> 00:59:48.420
I know how to do it.
我知道怎么做。

1362
00:59:49.040 --> 00:59:53.680
And he said that Paul just did it perfectly.
他说保罗演得简直完美。

1363
00:59:54.080 --> 00:59:54.380
Totally.
绝对是。

1364
00:59:54.700 --> 01:00:04.040
I also think this whole joke of Toby showing Pam how to throw a punch is a great example of a joke that lives in history in the character.
我也觉得托比教帕姆出拳这个笑话，很好地体现了角色背景故事对笑料的支撑。

1365
01:00:04.400 --> 01:00:06.200
This is part of Toby's history.
这是托比背景故事的一部分。

1366
01:00:06.440 --> 01:00:09.100
And we have gotten to know Toby so well.
我们已经非常了解托比了。

1367
01:00:09.100 --> 01:00:18.560
And we have seen years of Michael giving Toby, you know, such a hard time that, of course, of course, Toby's going to be like,
我们看了多年迈克尔给托比找麻烦，所以理所当然，理所当然，托比会说，

1368
01:00:18.780 --> 01:00:21.980
so the power comes from your back foot when you want to turn.
所以当你想要转身时，力量来自你的后脚。

1369
01:00:22.140 --> 01:00:23.620
Because it's so clear.
因为这太明显了。

1370
01:00:23.780 --> 01:00:30.040
The joke is in the subtext that Toby has fantasized about throwing a punch at Michael for years.
笑点在于潜台词，托比多年来一直幻想能给迈克尔一拳。

1371
01:00:31.020 --> 01:00:33.980
We had a fan catch from Efrat T.
我们收到了来自以色列的粉丝埃弗拉特·T的发现。

1372
01:00:34.140 --> 01:00:46.780
in Israel who just wanted to point out that when Michael hit Meredith with this car, he tells Ryan that it was on company grounds because it was the parking lot.
她指出，迈克尔开车撞到梅雷迪思时，他告诉瑞安那是在公司范围内，因为那是停车场。

1373
01:00:46.960 --> 01:00:47.960
Oh, good catch.
哦，好眼力。

1374
01:00:48.380 --> 01:00:56.040
But also in the duel, Andy and Dwight are fighting in the parking lot, and Jim tells them not to fight at work.
但在决斗那一集里，安迪和德怀特在停车场打架，吉姆告诉他们不要在工作场所打架。

1375
01:00:56.720 --> 01:01:06.300
So, just kind of pointing out, suddenly the parking lot is not company property, at least as far as Toby is concerned.
所以，只是想指出，停车场突然就不是公司财产了，至少在托比看来是这样。

1376
01:01:07.140 --> 01:01:11.560
That is a really good catch because technically she'd have to try to throw a punch out in the street.
这确实是个好发现，因为严格来说，她得去街上出拳才行。

1377
01:01:11.880 --> 01:01:13.540
Or at least on the sidewalk.
或者至少得在人行道上。

1378
01:01:13.880 --> 01:01:14.060
Yeah.
没错。

1379
01:01:14.860 --> 01:01:18.460
Well, speaking of the parking lot, everyone's gathered outside.
说到停车场，大家都聚集在外面了。

1380
01:01:19.560 --> 01:01:21.100
Kevin's money is on Pam.
凯文赌帕姆赢。

1381
01:01:21.980 --> 01:01:24.900
Oscar notes it's a one-sided fight.
奥斯卡指出这是一场一边倒的战斗。

1382
01:01:24.900 --> 01:01:28.900
It's not really, you know, Pam winning is the only outcome here.
并不是真的，你知道，帕姆获胜是唯一的结局。

1383
01:01:29.580 --> 01:01:31.240
Well, right now there's no Michael.
好吧，现在迈克尔还没出现。

1384
01:01:31.440 --> 01:01:32.160
There's just Pam.
只有帕姆在。

1385
01:01:32.380 --> 01:01:33.580
We can't find Michael.
我们找不到迈克尔。

1386
01:01:33.800 --> 01:01:36.980
Meredith checks the men's room, says the toilet seat is still warm.
梅雷迪思检查了男厕所，说马桶圈还是热的。

1387
01:01:37.660 --> 01:01:40.760
Thanks for putting your hand on the toilet seat, Meredith.
谢谢你把手放在马桶圈上，梅雷迪思。

1388
01:01:41.040 --> 01:01:41.920
I guess so.
我想也是。

1389
01:01:42.180 --> 01:01:43.560
Kelly has made popcorn.
凯利做了爆米花。

1390
01:01:44.320 --> 01:01:45.760
Yes, she has.
没错，她做了。

1391
01:01:45.860 --> 01:01:47.000
She's bringing snacks.
她带了零食过来。

1392
01:01:47.280 --> 01:01:49.180
And we find Michael in the stairwell.
然后我们在楼梯间找到了迈克尔。

1393
01:01:50.080 --> 01:01:50.600
Yeah.
是啊。

1394
01:01:50.600 --> 01:01:53.800
He's clearly trying to psych himself up for this moment.
他显然是在为这一刻给自己打气。

1395
01:01:54.660 --> 01:01:56.980
And he walks out to the parking lot.
然后他走到了停车场。

1396
01:01:57.580 --> 01:01:59.560
And Pam is going to wind up.
帕姆准备蓄力了。

1397
01:01:59.800 --> 01:02:01.600
She's going to wind up for the punch.
她准备挥拳了。

1398
01:02:01.840 --> 01:02:02.740
He flinches.
他退缩了。

1399
01:02:03.420 --> 01:02:08.940
And can I just say that Angela Martin, for once, is on Pam's side.
我能说安吉拉·马丁这次难得站在帕姆这边吗？

1400
01:02:09.160 --> 01:02:10.300
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1401
01:02:10.420 --> 01:02:12.100
Your line is so funny.
你的台词太搞笑了。

1402
01:02:12.880 --> 01:02:15.680
Pam says, Michael, you have to put your hands down.
帕姆说，迈克尔，你得把手放下。

1403
01:02:15.860 --> 01:02:18.380
Angela says, put your hands in your pockets.
安吉拉说，把手插进兜里。

1404
01:02:18.380 --> 01:02:24.420
So, this is just another person who is excited for Michael to get hit.
所以，这又是一个期待迈克尔挨打的人。

1405
01:02:24.620 --> 01:02:28.660
Well, as Pam is getting ready to hit Michael, he actually stops.
好吧，就在帕姆准备打迈克尔的时候，他居然停下了。

1406
01:02:28.920 --> 01:02:31.600
He apologizes to her for everything.
他为之前的一切向她道歉。

1407
01:02:32.440 --> 01:02:34.860
Pam takes it in, and she's like, okay.
帕姆听进去了，她心想，好吧。

1408
01:02:35.420 --> 01:02:35.840
Okay.
好吧。

1409
01:02:35.840 --> 01:02:37.180
She says, fine.
她说，行吧。

1410
01:02:37.340 --> 01:02:39.760
Don't date anyone else in my family ever again.
以后再也不准跟我家里的任何人约会了。

1411
01:02:39.820 --> 01:02:41.580
And she's going to walk away.
然后她准备走开。

1412
01:02:41.760 --> 01:02:42.500
She is.
她确实要走。

1413
01:02:42.700 --> 01:02:45.740
But Michael cannot shut his mouth.
但迈克尔就是管不住自己的嘴。

1414
01:02:46.200 --> 01:02:46.640
Yeah.
没错。

1415
01:02:46.640 --> 01:02:50.880
He says, for the record, your mom came on to me.
他说，郑重声明，是你妈先勾引我的。

1416
01:02:53.580 --> 01:03:00.840
Pam pivots on her heel and slaps him so hard across the face.
帕姆脚后跟一转，狠狠地给了他一记耳光。

1417
01:03:00.980 --> 01:03:06.100
And she's got that superhuman pregnancy strength, per Kelly.
而且正如凯莉所说，她当时拥有孕妇那种超人的力量。

1418
01:03:06.460 --> 01:03:07.500
We got a lot of mail.
我们收到了很多邮件。

1419
01:03:07.680 --> 01:03:09.820
I might say fan mail flurry.
我甚至想说是一阵粉丝来信的狂潮。

1420
01:03:10.300 --> 01:03:10.600
Oh.
哦。

1421
01:03:10.600 --> 01:03:11.700
So, Enoch N.
那么，来自宾夕法尼亚州的伊诺克·N.

1422
01:03:11.820 --> 01:03:15.060
from Pennsylvania wants to know, did Jenna really slap Steve?
想知道，珍娜真的打了史蒂夫吗？

1423
01:03:15.520 --> 01:03:17.900
And Angela, Katie M.
还有安吉拉，来自加州弗雷斯诺的凯蒂·M.

1424
01:03:18.000 --> 01:03:23.440
from Fresno, California said, quote, the moment Pam slaps Michael,
说，引用一下，帕姆打迈克尔的那一刻，

1425
01:03:23.820 --> 01:03:28.280
I absolutely believe Jenna could have played Sidney Bristow on Alias.
我绝对相信珍娜可以去《双面女间谍》里演悉尼·布里斯托。

1426
01:03:28.340 --> 01:03:29.220
Oh, Katie.
哦，凯蒂。

1427
01:03:30.040 --> 01:03:31.300
Okay, fine, Katie.
好吧，行吧，凯蒂。

1428
01:03:31.620 --> 01:03:32.140
I agree.
我同意。

1429
01:03:32.280 --> 01:03:35.120
This is a real Pam-kicking-some-butt moment.
这真是帕姆大显身手的时刻。

1430
01:03:35.660 --> 01:03:36.740
Jenna, you nailed it.
珍娜，你演得太棒了。

1431
01:03:36.900 --> 01:03:42.540
I am also curious because my character, as you know, slaps two people on this show,
我也很好奇，因为如你所知，我的角色在这部剧中打了两个人，

1432
01:03:42.560 --> 01:03:45.580
and I really did hit my co-stars.
而且我确实真的打了我的搭档。

1433
01:03:45.860 --> 01:03:48.380
Did you really hit Steve?
你真的打了史蒂夫吗？

1434
01:03:48.960 --> 01:03:50.020
I did not.
我没有。

1435
01:03:50.640 --> 01:03:53.020
Steve said I should hit him.
史蒂夫说我应该打他。

1436
01:03:53.440 --> 01:03:57.580
It did not seem safe to me because I am whipping around.
我觉得那样做不安全，因为我当时在挥动手臂。

1437
01:03:57.740 --> 01:04:05.700
If it was just a slap from a standing position, but this was like, I could not bring myself to do it.
如果只是站着打一巴掌还好，但这次动作幅度很大，我实在下不去手。

1438
01:04:06.000 --> 01:04:10.520
I think that's really smart because I hit Mike Schur on the run.
我觉得你那样做很明智，因为我是在奔跑中打了迈克·舒尔。

1439
01:04:10.720 --> 01:04:12.360
Your whole body goes into it.
你整个身体都投入进去了。

1440
01:04:12.660 --> 01:04:15.620
And he discussed that slap on our podcaSt.
他在我们的播客里讨论过那一巴掌。

1441
01:04:15.620 --> 01:04:19.220
Well, our stunt coordinator, Eric Solke.
嗯，我们的特技协调员，埃里克·索尔克。

1442
01:04:19.720 --> 01:04:20.800
Love Eric.
爱死埃里克了。

1443
01:04:21.180 --> 01:04:21.620
Yes.
是的。

1444
01:04:21.880 --> 01:04:26.540
He gave me very detailed instructions on how to pretend slap Steve.
他给了我非常详细的指导，教我如何假装打史蒂夫。

1445
01:04:27.160 --> 01:04:35.300
And he also worked with Matt Sohn on positioning the camera behind me so that you couldn't even tell that I'm not hitting him.
他还和马特·索恩一起工作，把摄像机放在我身后，这样你根本看不出我没打到他。

1446
01:04:36.020 --> 01:04:40.600
And then Randy told me that we added that slap sound in post-production.
然后兰迪告诉我，那个耳光声是我们在后期制作中加进去的。

1447
01:04:41.160 --> 01:04:44.100
So I did not slap Steve.
所以我并没有打史蒂夫。

1448
01:04:44.100 --> 01:04:47.600
Well, I'm glad you didn't because also you couldn't see him.
好吧，我很高兴你没打，因为当时你也看不见他。

1449
01:04:47.840 --> 01:04:49.280
Your back was to him.
你的背对着他。

1450
01:04:49.420 --> 01:04:49.720
Yes.
是的。

1451
01:04:50.140 --> 01:04:51.960
That's what I was worried about.
我担心的就是这个。

1452
01:04:52.320 --> 01:04:56.860
I mean, I was worried that I might make contact, but I was very specific.
我是说，我担心可能会碰到，但我当时非常小心。

1453
01:04:57.060 --> 01:04:58.460
Like, we lined up our bodies.
就像，我们对齐了身体。

1454
01:04:59.000 --> 01:05:01.940
My pivot was highly choreographed.
我的转身动作是精心编排过的。

1455
01:05:02.040 --> 01:05:04.360
I just pivoted on that one spot.
我就在那一个点上转身。

1456
01:05:04.780 --> 01:05:05.060
Yeah.
是啊。

1457
01:05:05.320 --> 01:05:06.380
You guys sold it.
你们演得真像。

1458
01:05:06.520 --> 01:05:08.200
I thought it totally worked.
我觉得效果完全达到了。

1459
01:05:08.200 --> 01:05:11.900
Well, at the end, Michael is limping away.
嗯，最后迈克尔一瘸一拐地走开了。

1460
01:05:12.680 --> 01:05:13.160
Limping.
一瘸一拐的。

1461
01:05:13.520 --> 01:05:13.960
I know.
我知道。

1462
01:05:14.140 --> 01:05:15.280
And Dwight's like, why are you limping?
德怀特问他，你为什么一瘸一拐的？

1463
01:05:15.400 --> 01:05:16.440
He's like, I don't know.
他说，我不知道。

1464
01:05:17.080 --> 01:05:19.380
Well, we had a fan question from M.E.L.
嗯，我们收到一个来自马里兰州巴尔的摩市M.E.L.的粉丝提问。

1465
01:05:19.400 --> 01:05:20.680
in Baltimore, Maryland.
马里兰州巴尔的摩市。

1466
01:05:21.460 --> 01:05:25.620
Was Michael's limping and Dwight's reaction scripted or improvised?
迈克尔的跛行和德怀特的反应是剧本写的还是即兴发挥的？

1467
01:05:26.120 --> 01:05:27.240
It was scripted.
是剧本写的。

1468
01:05:27.680 --> 01:05:27.980
Yeah.
是啊。

1469
01:05:28.120 --> 01:05:33.660
When I reread this shooting draft, almost every single thing you see was completely scripted.
当我重读这份拍摄剧本时，几乎你们看到的每一件事都是完全写好的。

1470
01:05:33.800 --> 01:05:35.040
All the little details.
所有的小细节。

1471
01:05:35.280 --> 01:05:35.580
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1472
01:05:36.080 --> 01:05:39.120
Well, fans had very mixed reactions to this slap.
嗯，粉丝们对这一巴掌的反应非常不一。

1473
01:05:39.880 --> 01:05:40.220
Yeah.
是啊。

1474
01:05:40.600 --> 01:05:43.720
A lot of people felt like it was one step too far.
很多人觉得这有点过火了。

1475
01:05:44.000 --> 01:05:46.040
They did not like Pam for doing this.
他们不喜欢帕姆这样做。

1476
01:05:46.380 --> 01:05:51.900
I think Steve is so good at playing the vulnerable side of Michael.
我觉得史蒂夫非常擅长演绎迈克尔脆弱的一面。

1477
01:05:52.660 --> 01:05:53.820
People were upset.
人们感到很不满。

1478
01:05:53.820 --> 01:05:56.860
How did we feel about it and re-watching it?
我们重看这一段时感觉如何？

1479
01:05:58.040 --> 01:06:02.220
I mean, I thought, you know, Pam was walking away.
我是说，我觉得，你知道，帕姆当时正要走开。

1480
01:06:02.780 --> 01:06:04.460
She wasn't going to do it.
她本来没打算动手的。

1481
01:06:04.700 --> 01:06:05.140
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1482
01:06:05.700 --> 01:06:08.580
And Michael just couldn't leave it alone.
但迈克尔就是不肯罢休。

1483
01:06:09.340 --> 01:06:19.140
I think that collectively, I remember the writers and producers felt that we couldn't end
我想大家一致认为，我记得编剧和制片人们觉得我们不能让

1484
01:06:19.140 --> 01:06:28.320
this story of Michael dating Pam's mom, doing this, like, highly insensitive thing to Pam.
迈克尔和帕姆妈妈约会这个故事，以这种对帕姆极其不敏感的行为结束。

1485
01:06:28.540 --> 01:06:35.600
Not only did he date her mom, he then broke up with her mom on her birthday in a public place.
他不仅和她妈妈约会，还在她妈妈生日那天在公共场合和她分手。

1486
01:06:36.480 --> 01:06:38.780
And he needed a comeuppance.
他需要得到报应。

1487
01:06:38.960 --> 01:06:40.700
He needed, yes, he did.
他确实需要，没错。

1488
01:06:41.000 --> 01:06:43.100
Him and Pam needed to settle this.
他和帕姆需要解决这件事。

1489
01:06:43.240 --> 01:06:44.380
And now it's settled.
现在解决了。

1490
01:06:44.940 --> 01:06:46.640
It's not going to fester.
它不会再发酵了。

1491
01:06:47.340 --> 01:06:55.700
So that was, I think, the reasoning behind it was that we needed to, this was now, it's been resolved.
所以我想这就是背后的逻辑，我们需要这样做，现在事情已经解决了。

1492
01:06:56.460 --> 01:07:01.120
You know, there were a few relationships on the show that reminded me of siblings.
你知道，剧里有几段关系让我想到了兄弟姐妹。

1493
01:07:01.440 --> 01:07:02.980
Like Angela, Oscar, and Kevin.
比如安吉拉、奥斯卡和凯文。

1494
01:07:03.280 --> 01:07:05.140
They were almost like siblings, you know?
他们就像兄弟姐妹一样，你懂吗？

1495
01:07:05.320 --> 01:07:06.440
Stanley and Phyllis.
斯坦利和菲利斯。

1496
01:07:06.560 --> 01:07:07.640
Stanley and Phyllis.
斯坦利和菲利斯。

1497
01:07:07.840 --> 01:07:11.040
And I felt like Pam and Michael were like brother and sister.
我觉得帕姆和迈克尔就像兄妹一样。

1498
01:07:11.320 --> 01:07:13.080
I think that's a really good analogy.
我觉得这个比喻非常贴切。

1499
01:07:14.380 --> 01:07:17.420
But yeah, I remember people were really chatting about this.
但确实，我记得当时人们真的在热议这件事。

1500
01:07:18.320 --> 01:07:23.600
Dwight is going to bring Michael inside and he says he's got some chicken he can put on that.
德怀特要把迈克尔带进去，他说他有鸡肉可以敷在上面。

1501
01:07:23.820 --> 01:07:25.680
Call back to all that chicken on the microwave.
回过头来说说微波炉里那只鸡的事。

1502
01:07:26.420 --> 01:07:28.140
Fan question from Victoria H.
来自俄亥俄州哥伦布市的维多利亚·H的粉丝提问。

1503
01:07:28.240 --> 01:07:29.180
in Columbus, Ohio.
在俄亥俄州哥伦布市。

1504
01:07:29.600 --> 01:07:34.460
Was Dwight holding real raw chicken on Michael's face or did Phil Shea make that?
德怀特当时是拿真的生鸡肉贴在迈克尔脸上，还是菲尔·谢伊做的道具？

1505
01:07:35.020 --> 01:07:36.080
Well, both.
嗯，两者都有。

1506
01:07:36.340 --> 01:07:41.260
It is real chicken that Phil Shea, like, shrink-wrapped.
那是真的鸡肉，菲尔·谢伊把它用保鲜膜包起来了。

1507
01:07:42.640 --> 01:07:48.040
So, it was real, but it was, like, covered in something so that it could.
所以它是真的，但外面包了层东西，这样它才能……

1508
01:07:48.280 --> 01:07:48.740
Gross.
恶心。

1509
01:07:49.740 --> 01:07:51.060
That is so gross.
太恶心了。

1510
01:07:51.060 --> 01:07:54.420
I thought for sure you're going to say, no, it's a fakie rubber chicken thing.
我本来以为你肯定会说，不，那是假的橡胶鸡道具。

1511
01:07:54.660 --> 01:07:56.520
No, it was real chicken.
不，那是真的鸡肉。

1512
01:07:56.980 --> 01:07:57.440
Wowzers.
哇哦。

1513
01:07:57.860 --> 01:07:58.180
Yeah.
是啊。

1514
01:07:58.940 --> 01:08:00.880
Well, Dwight thinks he finally did his favor.
德怀特以为他终于还了人情。

1515
01:08:00.900 --> 01:08:02.420
And he says, fire, Jim.
然后他说，吉姆，开火。

1516
01:08:03.040 --> 01:08:04.020
Michael's like, no.
迈克尔说，不行。

1517
01:08:04.460 --> 01:08:06.720
Dwight is angry and takes his dinner away.
德怀特很生气，把他的晚餐拿走了。

1518
01:08:07.400 --> 01:08:07.880
Yeah.
是啊。

1519
01:08:08.600 --> 01:08:11.560
He's going to eat that after it was on Michael's face.
他在那块鸡肉贴过迈克尔的脸之后还要吃掉它。

1520
01:08:11.940 --> 01:08:12.420
Apparently.
显然是这样。

1521
01:08:12.920 --> 01:08:17.420
You know, I feel like this episode wraps up best with the talking head that Michael had.
你知道，我觉得这一集最完美的结尾就是迈克尔的那段采访。

1522
01:08:17.920 --> 01:08:18.400
Yes.
没错。

1523
01:08:18.500 --> 01:08:19.640
I feel like I need to read it.
我觉得我得读一下。

1524
01:08:19.760 --> 01:08:20.500
Okay, please do.
好的，请读吧。

1525
01:08:20.800 --> 01:08:28.140
As I watched Pam's big, strong hand coming towards my face, I saw my entire life flash before my eyes.
当我看着帕姆那只又大又有力的手向我的脸挥过来时，我看到我的一生在眼前闪过。

1526
01:08:28.140 --> 01:08:29.000
And guess what?
你猜怎么着？

1527
01:08:29.280 --> 01:08:30.640
I have four kids.
我有四个孩子。

1528
01:08:30.980 --> 01:08:32.360
And I have a hover car.
我有一辆悬浮车。

1529
01:08:32.540 --> 01:08:33.800
And a hover house.
还有一栋悬浮房。

1530
01:08:34.040 --> 01:08:35.680
And my wife is a runner.
我妻子是个跑步健将。

1531
01:08:35.900 --> 01:08:36.840
And it shows.
而且身材很好。

1532
01:08:37.280 --> 01:08:39.760
And Pam and Jim are my best friends.
帕姆和吉姆是我最好的朋友。

1533
01:08:39.780 --> 01:08:41.300
And our kids play together.
我们的孩子在一起玩耍。

1534
01:08:41.560 --> 01:08:42.860
And I am happy.
我很幸福。

1535
01:08:43.020 --> 01:08:44.320
And I am rich.
我很有钱。

1536
01:08:44.540 --> 01:08:45.920
And I never die.
而且我永远不会死。

1537
01:08:46.500 --> 01:08:49.480
It doesn't sound like much, but it's enough for me.
听起来没什么大不了的，但对我来说已经足够了。

1538
01:08:50.280 --> 01:08:51.320
There you have it.
就是这样。

1539
01:08:51.440 --> 01:08:52.380
There you have it.
就是这样。

1540
01:08:52.380 --> 01:08:57.740
But Michael, in the end, just sees them as his family.
但迈克尔最终还是把他们看作自己的家人。

1541
01:08:58.220 --> 01:08:58.900
Always.
一直都是。

1542
01:08:59.360 --> 01:08:59.640
Always.
一直都是。

1543
01:09:00.700 --> 01:09:04.320
Next week, you guys, buckle in because it is murder.
下周，各位，系好安全带，因为我们要去查案了。

1544
01:09:04.880 --> 01:09:05.480
Ugh.
呃。

1545
01:09:05.880 --> 01:09:07.660
This is one of my biggest memes.
这是我最出名的梗之一。

1546
01:09:08.080 --> 01:09:08.760
Me too.
我也是。

1547
01:09:08.800 --> 01:09:11.660
People tag me all the time as Voodoo Mama Juju.
人们总是把我标记为巫毒妈妈朱朱。

1548
01:09:13.880 --> 01:09:16.080
That was Double Date, everyone.
以上就是《双重约会》这一集，大家再见。

1549
01:09:16.080 --> 01:09:25.260
Everyone, listen, check your glutes and maybe pick up some three-penis wine if your muscles are aching after your glute check.
各位，听着，检查一下你们的臀肌，如果检查完觉得肌肉酸痛，也许可以去买点三鞭酒。

1550
01:09:25.460 --> 01:09:28.080
We should probably go get some right now, Ange.
安吉，我们现在可能就该去买点了。

1551
01:09:28.180 --> 01:09:30.160
Skip the three-penis wine.
别喝那三鞭酒了。

1552
01:09:30.620 --> 01:09:31.540
We love you.
我们爱你。

1553
01:09:31.660 --> 01:09:32.380
See you next week.
下周见。

1554
01:09:32.420 --> 01:09:33.200
Have a great one.
祝你过得愉快。

